      <ol>
        <li>Select your country code</li>
        <li>Enter your WhatsApp number</li>
        <li>Optionally add a pre-filled message</li>
        <li>Click Generate — copy your wa.me link instantly</li>
      </ol>
      <p>You also get a free QR code download and UTM tracking support.</p>

      <div class="callout"><strong>Remember:</strong> Never include the + symbol, spaces, or dashes in your wa.me number. Always use the full international format: country code + local number as one continuous string.</div>
